SUMMARY:Mexico: Working week cut from 48 to 40 hours\, 2027-2030
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 Jan 2027. The reform reduces the maximum working we
 ek gradually: 46 hours in 2027\, 44 in 2028\, 42 in 2029 and 40 in 2030.\n
 \nSource: https://www.gob.mx/stps/documentos/reduccion-de-la-jornada-labor
 al-a-40-horas-preguntas-frecuentes?state=published\nDetails: https://www.i
 ntelligentpayroll.eu/countries/mexico.html#mx-40-hour-week\n\nFor informat
 ion only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
